VALUES ('4b495c1d-7992-533c-8ffe-a18ffea0c91a', '[{"type":"heading","props":{"level":1},"content":"[Demo] Notes from a slower afternoon"},{"type":"paragraph","content":"Demo content for exploring the reading experience. This article includes a long directory, nested sections, repeated headings, formatted text, and an inline image."},{"type":"image","props":{"url":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470770841072-f978cf4d019e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80","name":"demo-lakeside.jpg","caption":"Demo image — a quiet place by the water","previewWidth":720}},{"type":"heading","props":{"level":2},"content":"Starting with a blank page","id":"demo-section-1"},{"type":"paragraph","content":"The most useful notes are often the ones written before an idea feels complete. A sentence catches something small: the light across a table, a question from a conversation, or the moment a difficult problem begins to make sense. Leaving a little space around that sentence makes it easier to return."},{"type":"paragraph","content":"There is no need to turn every observation into a conclusion. Some days the work is simply to notice what changed and keep a record of it. Later, those fragments can become a map of how we learned, what we tried, and which details deserved another look."},{"type":"heading","props":{"level":2},"content":"A small idea worth keeping","id":"demo-section-2"},{"type":"paragraph","content":"The most useful notes are often the ones written before an idea feels complete. A sentence catches something small: the light across a table, a question from a conversation, or the moment a difficult problem begins to make sense. Leaving a little space around that sentence makes it easier to return."},{"type":"paragraph","content":"There is no need to turn every observation into a conclusion. Some days the work is simply to notice what changed and keep a record of it. Later, those fragments can become a map of how we learned, what we tried, and which details deserved another look